💼 CV uchun project nomi

Senga zo‘r nom:

Smart ERP API
CRM + POS + Inventory Management System

Bu CV’da juda premium ko‘rinadi


🔥 Xulosa
CRM → mijozlarni boshqarish, lead → client
POS → sotuvni boshqarish, receipt, cash tracking
Inventory → mahsulotni boshqarish, stock monitoring

Ular bir-biriga bog‘liq:

CRM client → POS sale
POS sale → Inventory update
Reports modul → barcha ma’lumotlarni birlashtiradi

Leads → Clients: CRM orqali
Client → Sale: POS orqali
Sale → Inventory: mahsulot stock kamayadi
Reports: har bir moduldan ma’lumot oladi

5️⃣ Ishlash logikasi (step by step)
Sales manager CRM’da lead yaratadi
Lead muloqotdan keyin clientga aylanadi
Client POS orqali buyurtma qiladi
Sale record POS’da yaratiladi
Mahsulot inventory’dan avtomatik kamayadi
Har bir deal va sale CRM va Reports’da ko‘rinadi
Reports → admin foydasi, best seller, monthly profit